<div data-ob-island="shipping"><div class="min-h-screen bg-background"><main><section class="bg-foreground py-14 md:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6"><p class="font-jost text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.7px] text-white/60">Legal</p><h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-[32px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-[48px]">Shipping Policy</h1></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] px-6 pt-10 pb-4"><p class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">This Shipping Policy explains how Online Blinds Express processes and delivers made-to-measure blind orders. Because each blind is custom manufactured, dispatch takes place after production is complete.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] px-6 pb-16 pt-4"><div class="divide-y divide-border"><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Order Processing</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>All blinds are made to measure. Manufacturing typically takes <strong>3–5 working days</strong> before dispatch. Once dispatched, your blinds are usually with you within <strong>2–3 working days</strong>, making the total delivery window approximately <strong>7–12 working days</strong> from order date. This timeframe may vary during busy periods or for large orders.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Shipping Costs</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p><strong>Free delivery</strong> on all orders over <strong>£250</strong> to UK mainland addresses.</p><p>A standard charge of <strong>£9.95</strong> applies to orders under £250.</p><p>Remote area surcharge of <strong>+£9.95</strong> applies to Northern Ireland, Scottish Islands, Isle of Man, and Isle of Wight. Contact us for Channel Islands deliveries (VAT-free).</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Delivery Tracking</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>As soon as your order is dispatched, we&#x27;ll send you an email with a <strong>tracking number and link</strong> <!-- -->so you can follow your delivery all the way to your door. If you haven&#x27;t received a dispatch email, please check your spam folder or contact us.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Delivery Address</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Please make sure your delivery address is complete and accurate before placing your order. We are not responsible for delays, failed deliveries, or additional charges caused by incorrect or incomplete delivery details supplied at checkout.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Receipt of Goods</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Deliveries may require a signature depending on the courier service used. If the packaging appears damaged on arrival, please sign for the item as damaged where possible and notify us immediately.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Damaged or Missing Items</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Any damage, missing items, or manufacturing defects must be reported by email to<!-- --> <a href="mailto:sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk">sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk</a> within<!-- --> <strong>3 working days</strong> of delivery. Please do not install or fit a blind if it appears damaged, as we may require photographs or the return of the item for inspection.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Failed Delivery</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Multiple unsuccessful delivery attempts may result in re-delivery charges. Items returned to us by the courier will be held for <strong>4 weeks</strong> before disposal.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Delays Outside Our Control</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>We are not liable for delivery delays caused by couriers, severe weather, customs or border checks, supply chain disruption, incorrect address details, or other events outside our reasonable control.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Contact</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>For shipping questions, please email<!-- --> <a href="mailto:sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk">sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk</a>.</p><p>Response time: <strong>1-3 working days</strong>.</p></div></div></div></section></main></div></div>